# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout, on any system (as in
# Godot's own project template). Without it the material generator on Windows
# rewrote every .tres in CRLF, and a multi-line string in a CRLF script carried
# a CR into the text on screen. Binary files are never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.res binary
*.scn binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pck binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
